{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2023-08", "window": 2, "start_date": 1691452800, "end_date": 1692143999, "month_true_total": 106, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:58:45 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "144265742", "author": {"steamid": "76561198079524390", "personaname": "- Ping Crimson -", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198079524390/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 3606, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2829, "last_played": 1745401628, "avatar": "cd841fc46302d396827f94521f44b8279a6d0fdd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Install a few quality-of-life mods from Nexus (like the ME:A Fixpack), and Andromeda becomes \"What if Mass Effect 1 was released today, except they tried a *little* too hard to copy Ubisoft's open world ethos?\"\n\nIn short, a genuinely good, engaging, fun game with likeable characters... That overstays its welcome when it comes to lengthy sidequests that often don't impact the world/story in significant ways. Ignore the \"it's not Mass Effect\" haters, pick it up on sale, and give it a try", "timestamp_created": 1692110476, "timestamp_updated": 1692110476, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.510022282600402832", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "144254855", "author": {"steamid": "76561197983456827", "personaname": "Jambec", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197983456827/", "num_games_owned": 1194, "num_reviews": 164, "playtime_forever": 232, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 232, "last_played": 1692063444, "avatar": "6f86bde126c6533c23519ab0b581553ff88a2dee"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm sorry my face is tired from staring at this game deciding whether or not to continue playing it.\n\nCons : Story, Characters, terrible dialogue that makes me want to rip my ears off. My character who is supposed to be what looks like 25 years of age has more wrinkles than Gordan Ramsay on a hot summer day, why does my little bit of hair on my head sway back and forth like im underwater? its so off putting, constantly scanning everything, far too much mundane dialog i winded up skipping majority.\n\nPros : Jetpack Jumping, Pretty graphics", "timestamp_created": 1692101244, "timestamp_updated": 1692101306, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.56081080436706543", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "144222222", "author": {"steamid": "76561198207439273", "personaname": "Brooks", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198207439273/", "num_games_owned": 338, "num_reviews": 76, "playtime_forever": 366, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 366, "last_played": 1692059931, "avatar": "fb293bbac4dfbbd98a85fa04dbbd98ad8395d394"}, "language": "english", "review": "Ye", "timestamp_created": 1692061555, "timestamp_updated": 1692061555, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "144216316", "author": {"steamid": "76561199096212278", "personaname": "GunnieSargePa", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199096212278/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 2619, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1716, "last_played": 1692409664, "avatar": "4625ace2f2fa70ae90380eaf2e151832b4526980"}, "language": "english", "review": "Mass Effect Andromeda is not close to the best Mass Effect game, but it still gives a great story that i wish they would follow up on. I wish they would make a sequel to. With all the negative reviews it got and the very little support it got the company scrapped the idea of a second game. There's so much lore and story they could follow up with, but it will never see the light of day.", "timestamp_created": 1692054469, "timestamp_updated": 1692054469, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "144192052", "author": {"steamid": "76561199065502285", "personaname": "Lamey2002", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199065502285/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3781, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3781, "last_played": 1692029248, "avatar": "cdff433c9ea96c9933449fa59011b1dc31a4f0a2"}, "language": "english", "review": "8/10.Solid game that was criticized far too much. It has a number of bugs that are annoying but i didn't encounter any that broke the game for me. Story was solid and gameplay was up to modern standards.", "timestamp_created": 1692029358, "timestamp_updated": 1692029358, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}]}